OL,3,GNEWSAChurch leads tributes for man
OL,4,Akilled at festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man killed at the Big Church
OL,7,FFestival in Worthing on Friday has been
OL,8,Fnamed by his church as Robert Guanco,
OL,9,F41.
OL,11,FHe was a pastor at Jesus the Living
OL,12,FWater Church in Eastbourne, East
OL,13,FSussex.
OL,15,FSix other people were injured at the
OL,16,Fevent by a falling sign, four of whom
OL,17,Fwere taken to hospital for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
